title: "FireChronicle: harmonized MODIS-VIIRS active fire calendar for Central Asia, 2000-2026"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Deep Space AI team"
date-released: "2026-11-15"
url: "https://komilovsg.github.io/firechronicle/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/komilovsg/firechronicle"
abstract: "A static web app and dataset that put MODIS and VIIRS active-fire detections for Central Asia on one MODIS-equivalent scale, 2000 to 2026. Data: NASA FIRMS. Not an official NASA product."
keywords:
